    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82988" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηνίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾱνίσδομαι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήνη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wind thread off a reel for the woof</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philyll.
				33
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1141.34
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>: generally, <i>wind off a reel</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ ταλάρω π. ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					18.32
				</span></i>
			:—later in 
				Act.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				137
			</span></i>.</div>
